---
import WalkthroughLayout from '../../layouts/WalkthroughLayout.astro';
import ChapterCard from '../../components/ChapterCard.astro';
import TacticalBriefing from '../../components/TacticalBriefing.astro';
import AsciiMap from '../../components/AsciiMap.astro';
import BossCard from '../../components/BossCard.astro';
import ShopMatrix from '../../components/ShopMatrix.astro';
import Callout from '../../components/Callout.astro';
import Tag from '../../components/Tag.astro';

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;

const quickJumps = [
  {
    "id": "ch41",
    "number": 41,
    "title": "Cygnus (Standard Chapter 5)",
    "timeline": "Standard"
  },
  {
    "id": "ch42",
    "number": 42,
    "title": "Itolia Wasteland (Standard Chapter 5)",
    "timeline": "Standard"
  },
  {
    "id": "ch43",
    "number": 43,
    "title": "Itolia Wasteland (Standard Chapter 6)",
    "timeline": "Standard"
  },
  {
    "id": "ch44",
    "number": 44,
    "title": "Skalla (Standard Chapter 6)",
    "timeline": "Standard"
  },
  {
    "id": "ch45",
    "number": 45,
    "title": "Abyssia Forest (Standard Chapter 6)",
    "timeline": "Standard"
  },
  {
    "id": "ch46",
    "number": 46,
    "title": "Holff Ruins (Standard Chapter 6)",
    "timeline": "Standard"
  },
  {
    "id": "ch47",
    "number": 47,
    "title": "Granorg (Standard Chapter 6)",
    "timeline": "Standard"
  },
  {
    "id": "ch48",
    "number": 48,
    "title": "Celestia (Alternate Chapter 4)",
    "timeline": "Alternate"
  },
  {
    "id": "ch49",
    "number": 49,
    "title": "Lazvil Hills (Alternate Chapter 4)",
    "timeline": "Alternate"
  },
  {
    "id": "ch50",
    "number": 50,
    "title": "Judgement Cliff (Alternate Chapter 4)",
    "timeline": "Alternate"
  }
];

const stats = {
  chapters: 10,
  nodes: 15,
  endings: 3,
  sidequests: 5,
  bosses: 5
};

const prevVol = { num: 4, title: 'Desert City Cygnus & Gladiator Trials', href: `${baseUrl}walkthrough/volume-4/` };
const nextVol = { num: 6, title: 'Granorg Liberation & Shadow of Dias', href: `${baseUrl}walkthrough/volume-6/` };
---

<WalkthroughLayout
  volume={5}
  volumeTitle="Beastkind Stronghold & Skalla Infiltration"
  chapterRange="Chapters 41–50"
  description="Forgia's elder council, Itolia Wasteland skirmishes, uncovering Dias's conspiracy, and Beastkind unification."
  stats={stats}
  quickJumps={quickJumps}
  prevVol={prevVol}
  nextVol={nextVol}
>

  <!-- Chapter 41 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch41"
    number={41}
    title="Cygnus (Standard Chapter 5)"
    timeline="Standard"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="42" party="Stocke, Raynie, Marco"
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Scorching Battlefield">
        <p>After resting at the inn, head west to the plaza, and look for <Tag type="char">Ricky</Tag> along the main road. Talk to him to receive the [An Unwanted Reunion] sidequest. Head to the tavern and talk to the green-haired girl, <Tag type="char">Mimel</Tag>, twice. Return to the &quot;Chi-Clad Warrior&quot; node and talk to the bartender. Return to the &quot;Scorching Battlefield&quot; node and talk to Mimel again to be prompted for a decision. Choosing to &quot;Capture Mimel&quot; will unlock the [Simmering Fury] ending.</p>
      </Callout>
      <p>Otherwise, choosing to &quot;Let Mimel go&quot; will advance [An Unwanted Reunion]. Talk to Ricky again to complete the [An Unwanted Reunion] sidequest and receive the <Tag type="armor">Sable Larme</Tag> (DEF+33/MDF+25/MAG+5, equip on <Tag type="char">Raynie</Tag>).</p>
      <p>Head up to <Tag type="place">Cygnus HQ</Tag> and talk to <Tag type="char">Garland</Tag> to be prompted for a decision. Choosing to &quot;Stay in Cygnus&quot; will unlock the [A Mighty King&#x27;s Death] ending.</p>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Warlord's Request">
        <p>Instead, return to this node and choose to &quot;Lead the way&quot;. After some events, you will receive the <Tag type="key">Bloodied Armlet</Tag>.</p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Dias Strikes">
        <p>Return to the &quot;Desert City Messiah&quot; node and proceed with events as before. This time, you will get an extra scene that will unlock the [Hedge in Exile] node. Return to the &quot;Warlord&#x27;s Request&quot; node, choose to &quot;Lead the way&quot; and events will proceed more favorably this time.</p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 42 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch42"
    number={42}
    title="Itolia Wasteland (Standard Chapter 5)"
    timeline="Standard"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="42" party="Stocke, Eruca, Marco" enemies={[{"name": "Desert Mercenary", "weakness": "Sleep"}, {"name": "Granorg Blitzer", "weakness": "Sleep"}, {"name": "Red Granorg Archer"}]}
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <ShopMatrix title="Traveling Merchant" items={[{"name": "First Aid Kit       400     Bastard Sword", "price": 4000}, {"name": "Tourniquet         1000     Goldy Lance", "price": 4300}, {"name": "Special Tea        1200     Steel Gauntlet", "price": 3400}, {"name": "Holy Water          500     Mueke Knife", "price": 3800}, {"name": "Anti-Poison          50     Solid Slugs", "price": 3800}, {"name": "Anti-Fear            50     Iron Mail", "price": 2400}, {"name": "Anti-Paralytic       50     Chain Kimono", "price": 1900}, {"name": "Anti-Curse           50     Gold Clothes", "price": 3200}, {"name": "Anti-Sleep           50     Iron Breastplate", "price": 6500}, {"name": "Anti-Stone           50     Gold Dress", "price": 5100}, {"name": "Panacea             800     Iron Charm", "price": 2500, "note": "buy 4"}, {"name": "Poison Wing         350     Crystal Charm", "price": 2500, "note": "buy 8"}, {"name": "Sleep Wing          500     Bishop Stud", "price": 3000}, {"name": "Divine Water       1500     Sprig Ring", "price": 5000}]} itemTitle="Inventory" />
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Stocke Strikes">
        <p>To the left is a traveling merchant with new accessories. Buy <Tag type="acc">8 Crystal Charms</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Stocke</Tag>, <Tag type="char">Raynie</Tag>, &amp; <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag>. If you have the money, buy <Tag type="acc">4 Iron Charms</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Rosch</Tag> &amp; <Tag type="char">Gafka</Tag> later. Stocke should pretty much be a full-time mage for the remainder of the game, since his physical attacks don&#x27;t deal as much damage.</p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
        <p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game:<br/>
        <strong>Stocke:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Pieti Edge</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Gospel Armor</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Raynie:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Magic Spear</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Sable Larme</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Marco:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Madre Blade</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Iron Mail</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Bishop Stud x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Aht:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Silver Dagger</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Life Robe</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Bishop Stud x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Eruca:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Solid Slugs</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Rune Dress</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Extra:</strong> <Tag type="armor">Moirae Manteau</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">4 Iron Charms</Tag></p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Secret Weapons">
        <p>Go north to begin taking out the Ballistas. Head right to find a chest which contains <Tag type="item">3 Special Teas</Tag>. The other paths are blocked for now, so head west to find your first batch of ballistas. Let&#x27;s take out the one in the upper left corner first. Then, the one in the lower left corner.</p>
      </Callout>
      <BossCard name="Ballista, Granorg Blitzer x3" weakness="Fire, Sleep">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> You can use <Tag type="skill">Sleep Gas</Tag> to crowd control the Blitzers. If you have enough starting turns, use two <Tag type="skill">Left Assaults</Tag> and a <Tag type="skill">G-Frost</Tag> to take them out. Use the <Tag type="skill">Change</Tag> command to string together all 10 turns. Have <Tag type="char">Marco</Tag> use all of his turns casting <Tag type="skill">Trans-turn</Tag> on <Tag type="char">Stocke</Tag>. Then, arrange your turns like so: <Tag type="skill">Double Slash</Tag>, <Tag type="skill">Mana Shot</Tag>, Double Slash, Mana Shot, Double Slash, Mana Shot, <Tag type="skill">Steal</Tag>, Steal, Steal, Steal, to boost the combo bonus, hopefully allowing you to steal the <Tag type="weapon">Freikugel Kreuz</Tag> (ATK+4/MAG+35/DEF-3) for <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag>. Equipping him with the <Tag type="armor">Gospel Armor</Tag> to boost his Luck will help immensely.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <p>You can equip <Tag type="char">Stocke</Tag> with his <Tag type="armor">Moirae Manteau</Tag> and hand down the <Tag type="armor">Gospel Armor</Tag> to <Tag type="char">Marco</Tag> after stealing the new gun for <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag>. Before heading back, check out the well in the area to the west. Climb down the well to find a chest which contains a <Tag type="item">Celestial Oil</Tag>. The man here appears to have been waiting for you, but won&#x27;t say why. Remember that for later. Return back two screens.</p>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Garland's Arrival">
        <p><Tag type="char">Garland</Tag> will arrive with explosives. Unfortunately, they do not work on the northern barricades, so drag a barrel to blow up the eastern rocks. Go east two screens and search the upper right corner for a hidden chest which contains <Tag type="gold">3000 G</Tag>. Head back west, then north, and west a screen to find a chest which contains an <Tag type="acc">Iron Charm</Tag>. Return east and head north.</p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Destroy the Ballistas">
        <p>Search along the upper wall to find a hidden chest which contains the <Tag type="key">Poisoner's Scroll</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Raynie</Tag>. Then, take out the two ballistas in the upper right and lower right corners, where you can apply the same strategies as before. Temporarily give Raynie&#x27;s <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charms</Tag> to <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag>, bring her in to replace <Tag type="char">Marco</Tag>, and head back to talk to <Tag type="char">Garland</Tag>.</p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Terrain Advantage">
        <p>With the ballistas destroyed, there&#x27;s only one more enemy to take care of, as well as an old friend.</p>
      </Callout>
      <BossCard name="Gardner, Palomides" weakness="Lightning">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> Use a <Tag type="item">Magic Herb</Tag> on <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag> and have <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag> cast <Tag type="skill">Regenerate</Tag>. <Tag type="boss">Gardner</Tag> can cast support and healing spells, so you want to take him out first. I would avoid using the <Tag type="skill">Change</Tag> command to set up combos, as their attacks can really hurt. Your main source of damage will be <Tag type="skill">Electric Traps</Tag>, but don&#x27;t worry so much about getting both of them onto the same one, as taking out Gardner first. You could steal a <Tag type="armor">Giant Armor</Tag> from <Tag type="boss">Palomides</Tag>, but you already have better.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: A New Journey">
        <p>After returning to <Tag type="place">Cygnus</Tag>, leave the city to proceed to Chapter 6.</p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
        <p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game:<br/>
        <strong>Stocke:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Pieti Edge</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Moirae Manteau</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Raynie:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Magic Spear</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Sable Larme</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Marco:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Madre Blade</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Gospel Armor</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Bishop Stud x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Aht:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Silver Dagger</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Life Robe</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Bishop Stud x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Eruca:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Freikugel Kreuz</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Rune Dress</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Extra:</strong> <Tag type="acc">5 Iron Charms</Tag></p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 43 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch43"
    number={43}
    title="Itolia Wasteland (Standard Chapter 6)"
    timeline="Standard"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="44" party="Stocke, Aht, Eruca" enemies={[{"name": "Black Curtain", "weakness": "Fire"}, {"name": "Cockatrice", "weakness": "Lightning"}, {"name": "Fanatic", "weakness": "Ice"}, {"name": "Grypender", "weakness": "Ice"}]}
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <AsciiMap>
<pre>__                          ________
               |1 |         | |            |        |    S - Save Point
               /XX|       __| |            |   MR   |    X - Roadblock
              /XXX|      |     \_____   ___|   RR   |    R - Rocks
             /XXXX|_     |       _ __   ___   ______|    M - Moon Armlet
            /       |    |___   | |        | |           1 - Tungsten Mail
           /       _|        |XX| |
          |       |___   ____|  | |        | |
          |                     | |__   __/S |
          |_       ___   ___    |____   __   |
            \_____/         \   \         \  |
                            |   /          | |
                            |  |           | |
   _____
  |     |  _______          |  |           | |            _____
  |     | |       |         |  |          /   \          /     \
  |_   _| |____   |         |XXX\____   _/     \___   __/       \__
    | |        |  |        /    X
          _____|  |__   __/     X____   __     ____   __         __
    | |__/                     /  __      \___/         \       /
    |____          __   __    |__/  |                    \_____/
         \________/       \         |
                           \       /
                            \   __/
                            |  |</pre>
      </AsciiMap>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Waiting at Skalla">
        <p>Before heading to <Tag type="place">Skalla</Tag>, we&#x27;ve got a lot of sidequests to do. First, return to <Tag type="place">Cygnus</Tag> and talk to <Tag type="char">Garland</Tag> to receive the [Moon Armlet] sidequest. Then, head over to the equipment shops. Talk to <Tag type="char">Hertz</Tag> &amp; <Tag type="char">Bram</Tag> over there to receive [The Good Thief&#x27;s Way] sidequest. Go back to the <Tag type="place">Itolia Wasteland</Tag>.</p>
      </Callout>
      <p>At this point, <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag> should have learned <Tag type="skill">Cross Star</Tag> and <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag> should have learned <Tag type="skill">Blizzard</Tag>. If so, you really shouldn&#x27;t have to worry about using traps for now. Just use Assault and those two spells to deal with all the enemies.</p>
      <p>Return to the well that is north, west, and north one screen from the initial save point. Go down the well and the man, named <Tag type="char">Sword</Tag>, is ready to talk to you now and give you [The Living Legend] sidequest. Leave the well area, then walk east two screens and north two screens. You should see a small rock formation in the middle. Search around there for the hidden <Tag type="key">Moon Armlet</Tag>.</p>
      <p>Head west to find some rocks you&#x27;ll need to blow away. Go past them, and west again. You can find a hidden barrel along the lower cliff that you will need in addition to the two visible ones, in order to get past the rocks to the north, but if you do, you&#x27;ll be well rewarded with a chest which contains the <Tag type="armor">Tungsten Mail</Tag> (DEF+42/MDF+24/SPD-2, equip on <Tag type="char">Marco</Tag>). Save the Gospel Armor for later. Talk to <Tag type="char">Garland</Tag> at <Tag type="place">Cygnus</Tag> to complete the [Moon Armlet] sidequest and receive the <Tag type="weapon">Suna-Watari</Tag> (ATK+42/SPD-4, sell).</p>
      <p>Return to &quot;The Beginning&quot; node. Talk to <Tag type="char">Wand</Tag>, the boy at the weapon shop, and choose &quot;Hope&quot; to advance [The Living Legend] sidequest. While you are here, talk to the child by the tavern to advance [The Good Thief&#x27;s Way] sidequest.</p>
      <p>Return to &quot;The Messenger&#x27;s News&quot; node and search the upper right corner for the hidden <Tag type="key">Shade Pact</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Stocke</Tag>. Return to the &quot;Castle Sewers&quot; node. Talk to a man in the lower left corner named <Tag type="char">Pentacle</Tag>, and choose &quot;The Past&quot; to advance [The Living Legend] sidequest. While you are here, talk to the boy to the left of the inn to advance [The Good Thief&#x27;s Way] sidequest.</p>
      <p>Return to the &quot;How to Disappear&quot; node, go down the sewers, and head west one screen. Search the left of the upper paths to find the hidden <Tag type="key">Sunlight Pact</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag>.</p>
      <p>Return to &quot;The Beastkind Forest&quot; node and talk to <Tag type="char">Chalice</Tag>, the lady by the equipment shop. Choose &quot;All Things&quot; to advance [The Living Legend] sidequest. Search to the left of the sparkling bushes at the center of town to find the hidden <Tag type="key">Meteorite Pact</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag>.</p>
      <p>Return to the &quot;Waiting at Skalla&quot; node and talk to <Tag type="char">Sword</Tag> at the well to complete [The Living Legend] sidequest. He will introduce you to <Tag type="char">Vainqueur</Tag>, who can teach new abilities to Stocke, Aht, and Eruca. Talk to him again to receive [The Blades Trial], [The Starlit Trial], [The Light Trial], and [The Three Contracts] sidequests. If you&#x27;ve followed the walkthrough up to now, you should be able to teach 3 abilities to Stocke, 2 abilities to Aht, and 3 abilities to Eruca.</p>
      <p>Go back to <Tag type="place">Cygnus</Tag> and talk to <Tag type="char">Bram</Tag> to complete [The Good Thief&#x27;s Way] and receive the <Tag type="key">Piercing Scroll</Tag> from <Tag type="char">Hertz</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Raynie</Tag>. This would also be a good time to return to &quot;A New Mission&quot; to teach those new scrolls to Raynie.</p>
      <p>When you are ready, return to the <Tag type="place">Itolia Wasteland</Tag>. Simply head straight north and blow up all the rocks along the way to reach the northern exit that will lead you to <Tag type="place">Skalla</Tag>.</p>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 44 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch44"
    number={44}
    title="Skalla (Standard Chapter 6)"
    timeline="Standard"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="45" party="Stocke, Aht, Eruca" inn="100 G"
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <ShopMatrix title="Skalla (Standard Chapter 6) Merchant" items={[{"name": "Soothing Balm", "price": 100}, {"name": "First Aid Kit", "price": 400}, {"name": "Tourniquet", "price": 1000}, {"name": "Herbal Tea", "price": 350}, {"name": "Special Tea", "price": 1200}, {"name": "Healing Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "Holy Water", "price": 500}, {"name": "Anti-Poison", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Fear", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Paralytic", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Curse", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Sleep", "price": 50}, {"name": "Anti-Stone", "price": 50}, {"name": "Panacea", "price": 800}, {"name": "Panacea Plus", "price": 2000}, {"name": "Poison Wing", "price": 350}, {"name": "Sleep Wing", "price": 500}, {"name": "Power Down", "price": 500}, {"name": "Might Herb", "price": 500}, {"name": "Divine Water", "price": 1500}]} equipment={[{"name": "Bastard Sword", "price": 4000}, {"name": "Alchemy Edge", "price": 9500}, {"name": "Goldy Lance", "price": 4300}, {"name": "Witch Spear", "price": 4800, "note": "buy for Raynie"}, {"name": "Steel Gauntlet", "price": 3400}, {"name": "Mueke Knife", "price": 3800}, {"name": "Death Dagger", "price": 5200}, {"name": "Solid Slugs", "price": 3800}, {"name": "Iron Mail", "price": 2400}, {"name": "Gold Clothes", "price": 3200}, {"name": "Iron Breastplate", "price": 6500}, {"name": "Running Sand", "price": 3800}, {"name": "Gold Dress", "price": 5100}, {"name": "Shadowrun Dress", "price": 5600}, {"name": "Iron Charm", "price": 2500}, {"name": "Crystal Charm", "price": 2500}, {"name": "Bishop Stud", "price": 3000}, {"name": "Sprig Ring", "price": 5000}, {"name": "Peridot", "price": 1750}, {"name": "Amazonite", "price": 1750}]} itemTitle="Item Shop" equipmentTitle="Equipment Shop" />
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: An Introduction">
        <p>After some initial dialogue, head to the weapon shop to the right where you should buy a <Tag type="weapon">Witch Spear</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Raynie</Tag>. Below the weapon shop is a hidden chest which contains the <Tag type="key">Thunderstar Pact</Tag> for <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag>. Enter the center house to talk to <Tag type="char">Tarquin</Tag> again. He will give you the <Tag type="key">Sand Sword</Tag> to advance the [Sand Sword] sidequest and unlock the [Merchant Tarquin] node. Talk to him again to advance the [Mercenary Recruit] sidequest. Head to the inn to meet <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag>&#x27;s contact.</p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: To Holff Ruins">
        <p>You will need to pass through the <Tag type="place">Itolia Wasteland</Tag> and <Tag type="place">Abyssia Forest</Tag> in order to reach the ruins. From the northern entrance of the Itolia Wasteland, head east one screen, south two, and east one. Pass the Gutrals to the east to make it to the Abyssia Forest.</p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
        <p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game:<br/>
        <strong>Stocke:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Pieti Edge</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Moirae Manteau</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Raynie:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Witch Spear</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Sable Larme</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Marco:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Madre Blade</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Tungsten Mail</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Bishop Stud x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Aht:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Silver Dagger</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Life Robe</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Bishop Stud x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Eruca:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Freikugel Kreuz</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Rune Dress</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Extra:</strong> <Tag type="armor">Gospel Armor</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">5 Iron Charms</Tag></p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 45 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch45"
    number={45}
    title="Abyssia Forest (Standard Chapter 6)"
    timeline="Standard"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="45" party="Stocke, Aht, Eruca" enemies={[{"name": "Army Wasp", "weakness": "Ice"}, {"name": "Blom"}, {"name": "Rose Balsam", "weakness": "Fire"}, {"name": "Stompy", "weakness": "Fire"}, {"name": "Wood Fang", "weakness": "Fire"}]}
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <AsciiMap>
<pre>| |       S - Save Point
                                 /   \      G - Guard
     ______ ______              |   __|     * - Sneak attacks
    |    G2|      |             |____ |     1 - Beast Charm
    |  _   |3  _  |             |____ |     2 - Roll-Cut Scroll
