, "price": 3000}, {"name": "Flower Ring", "price": 10000}]} itemTitle="Item Shop" equipmentTitle="Equipment Shop" />
      <p>With those obstacles cleared, you can enter the city. First, head east to make the recommended purchases listed above. Then, I&#x27;d strongly recommend scouring the city for every last soldier you can find and kill. They come in large groups and give great experience.</p>
      <p>Besides <Tag type="char">Stocke</Tag> and <Tag type="char">Eruca</Tag>, use whoever you want in the third slot, as Eruca can one-shot almost anything with her <Tag type="skill">Burst Light</Tag>. For BIG enemies, you may want to launch them with <Tag type="skill">Air Assault</Tag> or <Tag type="skill">Cross Star</Tag> first. I would try to keep my levels pretty even between the others, though keeping <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag> a couple levels ahead of the others is good, since she learns her final spells two levels after them.</p>
      <p>When you&#x27;re ready, rest up at the inn, and walk right in the front gate of the castle. Ballsy. Just walk straight up to the throne room to help Eruca claim her destiny.</p>
      <BossCard name="Heavy Granorgite x2, Protea Guards x2" weakness="Lightning, None">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> You don&#x27;t even need buffs for this fight, it&#x27;s so easy. Have <Tag type="char">Aht</Tag> lay a <Tag type="skill">Volt Star</Tag> trap in the lower left corner. Then, use <Tag type="skill">Push Assault</Tag> and <Tag type="skill">Left Assault</Tag> on the two Granorgites to kill them quickly. The blue Protea Guard may lay down a <Tag type="skill">Heal Zone</Tag>, which may slow things down, so kill her next. Use any Star trap and Assaults twice to take down each Guard, one by one.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <p>For defeating them, you will have completed your business in Standard History. Now, it is time to return to the &quot;A New Alliance&quot; node in Alternate History.</p>
      <Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
        <p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game:<br/>
        <strong>Stocke:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Pieti Edge</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Moirae Manteau</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Raynie:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Witch Spear</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Sable Larme</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Marco:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Gaia Blade</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Tungsten Mail</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Bishop Stud x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Aht:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Promised Knife</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Life Robe</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Bishop Stud x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Eruca:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">FMJ Rounds</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Jeweled Gown</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Crystal Charm x3</Tag><br/>
        <strong>Extra:</strong> <Tag type="weapon">Titanium Lance</Tag>, <Tag type="weapon">Alloy Gauntlet</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Gospel Armor</Tag>, <Tag type="armor">Alloy Plate</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">Beast Charm</Tag>, <Tag type="acc">5 Iron Charms</Tag></p>
      </Callout>
